        <mxCell id="12" value="Missing any one role, the capability is incomplete. Swap the Provider and you swap the whole capability; a remote sandbox moves Bash, PTY and LSP along with it." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#334155;" vertex="1" parent="1">
